t/issues/115843#issuecomment-4722886709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843","id":4722886709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGYGINQ","user":{"login":"dallinhsmith-gif","id":232573038,"node_id":"U_kgDODdzIbg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232573038?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif","html_url":"https://github.com/dallinhsmith-gif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dallinhsmith-gif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T19:56:57Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T19:56:57Z","body":"@AThousandShips Can this be reopened? You are mistaken. This is not an issue with the user forgetting to check \"Convert Colors With Editor Theme\" and reimporting. This is a legitimate bug.\n\nI have checked this property and reimported. When I change the color theme, the icon is not changing colors like it should. All the built in icons are changing instantly.\n\nMy custom icon is just a white circle. This is the code:\n\n```\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n<circle\n        cx=\"8\"\n        cy=\"8\"\n        r=\"2\"\n        fill=\"#ffffff\"\n        fill-opacity=\"0.878\" />\n</svg>\n\n```\n\nHow I know this is a bug is I can get it to swap colors under certain circumstances:\n\n1. If I make any unrelated change to the SVG file (even just add a comment line and no changes to the code), when it gets automatically reimported into Godot, it will instantly swap colors. \n2. If I go to the Import Tab and uncheck and then recheck \"Convert Colors With Editor Theme\" and then click reimport, it will instantly swap the colors. However, even after doing this and leaving the property checked, it still doesn't swap the colors if I change the theme again. \n\nRight clicking the file and selecting reimport does not fix it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4722886709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4723516143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115843#issuecomment-4723516143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843","id":4723516143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGYsi7w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThou